  title: Mine
  description: 'Your quarry: the dirt plot at the cliff''s edge. Stand on it and
    hold Dig to dig down; dig into the walls you walk into. Blocks are half a level
    tall, so you are two blocks tall: step up one block at a time, so leave steps
    (or build scaffolds with lumber) to climb back out. Deeper reaches the next layers
    (new ores, harder rock).'
  plannedPhase: 
  siteId: site.mine
